WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.259
First, open Copilot CLI.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.141
Type /sidekicks list to see your running sidekick agents.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.723
A panel lists your sidekicks.

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:17.325
Right now it says no sidekicks.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.927
Sidekicks are helper agents beside you.
